  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project draws on the experiences from the &#x201c;Bridges&#x201d; Project, but with an even greater emphasis on strategic programming to reach young Arab-speakers and documenting results. The obective is to promote open and inclusive democracies in the MENA region respecting the rights of religious minorities.</narrative>
  </description>
